stakes  are so high and so far faith healing has  passed no meaningful tests and until it  does it should be clearly called  pseudoscience and really one of the most  problematic pseudo-sciences faith has a  long complicated history interacting  with science and if you want to delve  deeper into the relationships between  mythology and empiricism check out class  central.com slash Pakman and check out a  new online course from the University of  Alberta  called science and religion 101 plus  central offers tens of thousands of  university courses on virtually any  topic you can imagine start searching  for top-rated college lectures from  world renowned universities by clicking  the link under the video they have  classes on almost everything business  science math computer programming  politics economics you'll definitely  find something you love and a lot of  those courses are completely free check  it out at class central.com slash  Packman or just click the link in the  video description below


